# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment — .env.example IS committed, real .env files are not
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .env
# .env.local
# .env.*.local
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data — raw downloads are large (~500 MB) and fully reproducible via
# `python -m app.scripts.ingest_*`; not tracked. data/processed/ (~80 MB) IS
# tracked despite being reproducible too — Railway's backend deploy reads it
# directly from the repo at startup instead of via a separate data-fetch step.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/

